a383f45/ss_79fc8ce575210ff6d367ff4567c14e6c5a383f45.600x338.jpg?t=1767544558"}],"short_description":"Tower Inc. is a survival horror of shifting floors, monsters, and betrayal. Collect quotas as fuel to keep the elevator running \u2014 without them, you won\u2019t survive the climb. Work with your team\u2026 or leave them behind.","steam_appid":2261310,"support_info":{"email":"roto-games@hotmail.com","url":"https://www.facebook.com/rotogames"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}